# Route: guide 37 of 53 of the simulator's completionist route for NightElf
# (1445 of 1459 eligible quests, 164.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 54 to
# 56, 44 quests, 2.9 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Western Plaguelands): Sorrow Hill -> Ruins of Andorhal -> Felstone
# Field -> Northridge Lumber Camp -> Felstone Field -> Northridge Lumber Camp
# -> Hearthglen -> The Weeping Cave -> Northridge Lumber Camp -> Hearthglen ->
# Northridge Lumber Camp -> Sorrow Hill -> Ruins of Andorhal -> ….
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Barov Family Fortune (5343), Doctor Theolen Krastinov, the
# Butcher (5382), Kirtonos the Herald (5384), The Lich, Ras Frostwhisper
# (5466), Krastinov's Bag of Horrors (5515), Of Love and Family (5848).

